      <h2 style="font-size:44px; max-width:20ch;">Chipset expertise, supply-chain depth, and customization at scale.</h2>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CHIPSET PLATFORMS -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="section-tag">Chipset Platforms</div>
          <h3>Two ecosystems. One commitment.</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="section-note">We go deep on Marvell and CENTEC — not broad across every available silicon.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="lead-text">Our product and engineering focus is concentrated on two chipset families. That concentration is intentional: it's what allows us to optimize feature sets continuously, hold meaningful inventory positions, and provide technical support that goes beyond datasheet reading.</p>
      <div class="chipset-grid">
        <div class="chipset-card">
          <div class="cc-badge">Primary Platform — Access Layer</div>
          <h4>Marvell Prestera</h4>
          <div class="cc-sub">AC5 Lite &middot; AC5 &middot; AC5+ — L2+ Managed Switching</div>
          <ul>
            <li>Commercial &amp; industrial grade — both deployment contexts covered</li>
            <li>8 / 16 / 24 / 48-port configurations &middot; PoE / PoE+ / PoE++ (IEEE 802.3af/at/bt, up to 90W/port)</li>
            <li>Dual PSU support &middot; hot-swappable power modules — zero downtime on power failure</li>
            <li>ERPS G.8032 ring protection — sub-20ms convergence &middot; STP / RSTP / MSTP</li>
            <li>QinQ double-tagging (port / VLAN / flow-based) &middot; Private VLAN &middot; Voice VLAN</li>
            <li>IGMP v1/v2/v3 snooping &middot; PIM-SM multicast &middot; MLD snooping &middot; Fast Leave</li>
            <li>802.1X + RADIUS + TACACS+ &middot; DAI &middot; IP Source Guard &middot; DDoS protection</li>
            <li>SFTP / SCP / SSH2 (public key) &middot; HTTPS &middot; SNMP v2c/v3 &middot; sFlow &middot; MQTT telemetry</li>
            <li>Dual firmware partition &middot; optical DDM monitoring &middot; one-click fault collection</li>
            <li>Fiber Bypass — LC female connector, 2ch single LC or 1ch dual LC, optical switching ≤10ms, insertion loss 1.2dB max</li>
            <li>DI / DO / RS485 — 1ch digital input (12–30V), 1ch digital output (2A@30V DC), 1ch RS485 with Modbus transparent transmission, TCP client/server mode</li>
            <li>Firmware actively developed — V7.5.x roadmap, continuous feature optimization</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="chipset-card secondary">
          <div class="cc-badge">Primary Platform — Aggregation / Core / Data Center</div>
          <h4>CENTEC</h4>
          <div class="cc-sub">L3 Aggregation &middot; Core &middot; Data Center — 10G to 800G</div>
          <ul>
            <li>Full L3 hardware-forwarded routing — OSPF, BGP, IS-IS, static routing</li>
            <li>IPv4/IPv6 dual-stack routing — OSPFv3, BGP4+</li>
            <li>EVPN-VXLAN fabric — scalable data center overlay networking</li>
            <li>MPLS / MPLS VPN — L2VPN, L3VPN and metro transport applications</li>
            <li>MLAG — dual-active redundancy and cross-chassis link aggregation</li>
            <li>Stacking — virtualized device management for simplified aggregation</li>
            <li>ECMP load balancing &middot; ACL &middot; QoS &middot; LACP hardware offload at line rate</li>
            <li>Port speeds: 10G SFP+ &middot; 25G SFP28 &middot; 40G QSFP+ &middot; 100G QSFP28 &middot; 400G QSFP112 &middot; 800G OSFP</li>
            <li>Data Center Bridging (DCB) — PFC and DCBX support</li>
            <li>Redundant hot-swappable power supplies (CRPS) &middot; intelligent hot-swap fan modules</li>
            <li>Suitable for enterprise aggregation, campus core, MAN, and data center ToR/spine</li>
            <li>Active platform development — strong R&amp;D continuity</li>
            <li>Merchant silicon based architecture · flexible hardware platform for OEM/ODM customization</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:20px; padding:16px 20px; border:1px solid var(--rule-light); background:var(--paper-deep);">
        <p style="font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; color:#666;">Realtek-based products also available as secondary line — primarily for price-sensitive buyers or supplementary SKU coverage. Suitable for standard L2 requirements where advanced feature depth is not the primary requirement.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

