      <p class="lead-text">The customization capability that matters most to serious OEM and ODM clients isn't cosmetic. It's the ability to modify firmware behavior, reshape management interfaces, and tune hardware configurations — at a depth that most Shenzhen-based suppliers either can't do or won't prioritize for mid-volume orders.</p>
